  "notes": "Usually positive: plainness by design, with nothing extra.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {簡素|かんそ}な⟦{生活|せいかつ}→生活：01443_seikatsu⟧: simple lifestyle\n- {簡素|かんそ}な⟦デザイン→デザイン：03860_dezain⟧: simple design\n- {簡素|かんそ}な{式|しき}: simple ceremony\n- {簡素|かんそ}{化|か}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to simplify (procedures, rules)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{質素|しっそ}→質素：09201_shisso⟧: simple, frugal — of a way of living and spending\n- ⟦{簡単|かんたん}→簡単：00713_kantan⟧: easy, simple — about ease, not plainness\n- ⟦{豪華|ごうか}→豪華：02815_gouka⟧: luxurious — the opposite",
